@startuml activity-create-product
' Create product: an admin adds a product from the dashboard.
' The two kinds of images are stored at the same time: fork and join.
' Precondition: the admin is signed in.

title Create product

|Admin|
start
:1 · Open Manage Products;
:2 · Click Add product;
:3 · Upload the Main Hero Shot;
:4 · Add Gallery Assets;
:5 · Enter name and description;
:6 · Pick category and status;
:7 · Enter the first variant\n(weight, unit, price, quantity);
:8 · Set roast and sourcing\n(origin, method, ethics, notes);
' The repeat start is the merge: step 9 is reached from step 8 or after a fix.
repeat :9 · Click Publish Product;

  |Coffee Shop System|
  :Check the form\n(fields, hero shot, gallery);
  if (Form complete?) then ([yes])
    fork
      |Image host|
      :Store the Main Hero Shot;
    fork again
      |Image host|
      :Store the Gallery Assets;
    end fork

    |Coffee Shop System|
    if (Images stored?) then ([yes])
      :Check the name and the category;
      if (Name already used?) then ([no])
        if (Category exists?) then ([yes])
          :Save the product\n(with its variant and images);
        else ([no])
        endif
      else ([yes])
      endif
    else ([no])
    endif
  else ([no])
  endif

  |Coffee Shop System|
backward :Show the errors, then the admin\nfixes the marked fields;
repeat while (Anything rejected?) is ([yes]) not ([no])

:Show "Product created";
:Open the products list;
stop

@enduml
